ses thrown  by bob greasy i mean jimmy garoppolo for  the san francisco 49ers  and look i know look  raheem moster who had 220 yards that day  is not there but  plug someone else in and off they go  jared mckinnon will be the guy  or or maybe jim michael hastie or  whoever whoever's healthy that day will  be the guy  uh and and they can continue to do it  look what dalvin cook did and i know  that  the best running back on the 49ers  roster isn't close to dalvin cook  but it's not about being emmett smith or  barry sanders or adrian peterson if  you're a 49ers running back it's about  running the plays that are called  and they're going to work and kyle's  going to come up  dial up last year's game plan rip  through that defense that defense is  already demoralized  they may not have aaron jones  offensively so i i just think that  that there's reason yeah for some  optimism here i'm not going to  automatically say the packers  go out there and knock out the 49ers i  think the 49ers are going to give them a  hell of a fight  and i think back to last year the more i  envisioned what happened last year right  maybe it maybe it's going to happen  again hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching  make sure to hit subscribe for the  latest news and highlights  from nbc sports

